<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Value Translation Challe=
nge:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Technical leaders must bridge th=
e gap between engineering excellence v=C3=A0 business outcomes. This requir=
es developing metrics that connect technical improvements to measurable bus=
iness impact.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>=F0=9F=92=AD Business Tr=
anslation:</strong> <em>At Amazon, we learned to express every technical pr=
oject in terms of customer experience and business metrics. "Reducing page =
load time by 100ms" becomes "improving conversion rate by 0.5%, resulting i=
n $X million additional revenue annually."</em></p>
